steps.instruction:
Set acquisition order according to Table 1: 
1) Alexa Fluor 790 (confocal only) – 750 nm excitation, 20 % AOBS; 
2) Abberior STAR 635P – 635 nm excitation (15 % AOBS), pulsed 775 nm STED (10 %); 
2‑alt) Atto 647N – 640 nm excitation (10‑15 % AOBS), pulsed 775 nm STED (10 %); 
3) Alexa Fluor 594 – 594 nm excitation (5‑12 % AOBS), pulsed 775 nm STED (15 %); 
4) Alexa Fluor 555 – 555 nm excitation (10 % AOBS), CW 660 nm STED (10‑15 %); 
5) Alexa Fluor 488 – 488 nm excitation (5‑10 % AOBS), CW 592 nm STED (10‑15 %).
Acquire all confocal channels before any STED channel.
